 as a key equivalent as long as pressing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it produces a single character value. Key equivalents are typically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"initialized using a single-character string literal, with constants for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unprintable or hard-to-type values."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The modifier keys necessary to type a key equivalent are factored in to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resulting keyboard shortcut. That is, a key equivalent whose raw value is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the capitalized string “A” corresponds with the keyboard shortcut","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Command-Shift-A. The exact mapping may depend on the keyboard layout—for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, a key equivalent with the character value “}” produces a shortcut","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"equivalent to Command-Shift-] on ANSI keyboards, but would produce a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"different shortcut for keyboard layouts where punctuation characters are in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"different locations.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/SQ":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Equatable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/KeyEquivalent/ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteral-Implementations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteral-Implementations","kind":"article","title":"ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteral Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/keyequivalent\/expressiblebyextendedgraphemeclusterliteral-implementations","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"collectionGroup"},"doc